# A prefix with its own (shadowed) binding followed by a key that leads
# nowhere: the binding runs, the key is read again (found from vi replace
# mode ESC in callback mode).
tags: keymap dispatch
--- inputrc
"ab": kill-word
"a": self-insert
=== cb-bound
--- script
callback "> " 1
--- keys
xa<pause>y<dumpfull>\r
=== cb-unbound
--- script
callback "> " 1
--- keys
xa<pause>\C-^<dumpfull>\r
=== cb-unbound-nopause
--- script
callback "> " 1
--- keys
xa\C-^<dumpfull>\r
=== rl-unbound
--- script
readline "> "
--- keys
xa\C-^<dumpfull>\r
=== rl-bound
--- script
readline "> "
--- keys
xay<dumpfull>\r
